            "text": "<p>We're driven by the belief that good health is a right, not a luxury. Our commitment to affordability means we work tirelessly to optimize our supply chain, reduce overheads, and implement efficient processes. </p><p>This allows us to offer premium products at prices that are fair and friendly to your wallet. Our factory-direct model cuts out the middlemen, passing the savings on to our customers. </p><p>We are proud to make wellness accessible to everyone, regardless of their financial situation.</p>",
