            "text": "<p>Trust is the cornerstone of our relationship with you. We're committed to transparency about our sourcing, manufacturing, and testing processes. </p><p>Our website and product packaging provide detailed information without making any unsubstantiated claims or promises. Our priority is to never use unwanted added ingredients and fillers. </p><p>Whether you’re speaking with a member of our customer service team or a licensed pharmacist, we are here to answer your questions, offer guidance, and provide the information you need to make informed choices about your health.</p>",
