        "text_kzeUyW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We go through a strict process to qualify all of our suppliers and before any ingredients or components arrive at our facilities. Our quality team ensures all necessary GMP protocols are followed before bringing in the laboratory team for testing. We work closely with reputable and ISO certified 3rd party laboratories to meet our testing requirements. Some of the laboratories we have worked with include: Eurofins, Certified Laboratories, Intertek, Brighton Laboratories, and Venture Laboratories to name a few.</p><p>Dedication to quality is an ongoing effort, which is why we continuously monitor and verify our processes, making adjustments whenever necessary.</p>",
